#NEXUS

[ hu2009a_fig4: Vertical time-calibrated theropod tree, root at the bottom, rotated labels, thick range bars; 18 tips, most of them collapsed clades. No matrix held: tips keep their printed text. Topology transcribed from the figure and checked node by node (2026-10-29); topology only. ]

BEGIN TAXA;
    DIMENSIONS NTAX=18;
    TAXLABELS
        Coelophysoidea
        Ceratosauria
        Basal_tetanurans
        Tyrannosauroidea
        Compsognathidae
        Ornithomimosauria
        Ornitholestes_hermanni
